    <x:String x:Key="Settings_ImeiInfoGuide">Setup Guide</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_ImeiInfoGuideStep1">Create an account on imei.info</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_ImeiInfoGuideStep2">Click 'API Manage' in the sidebar and copy your API key (e.g., e0d7c26f-5cc7-5644-863c-8992083dfeac).</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_ImeiInfoGuideStep3">Paste the API key in the input field above and click Save.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_ImeiInfoGuideStep4">Go to 'Add Credits' on the website to add funds to your account.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_ImeiInfoWhyTitle">Why this needs your own key</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_ImeiInfoWhy">IMEI checks run against your own imei.info account, so the key you paste below is yours and stays in this machine's settings file. PhoneGrade does not come with one.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_ImeiInfoWhyCredits">Each check is charged to the balance of that account at the price listed next to it, so add credits before the first one runs.</x:String>
